abstract: >-
  The Quran Vision Corpus (v6.2.3; supersedes v6.2.2), led and authored by Project Lead & Principal Investigator Mehmet Yarıcı (ORCID: 0009-0003-0356-8582; Uludağ University Faculty of Theology / Republic of Türkiye Ministry of National Education), with Academic Advisor Mehmet Emin Koç (ORCID: 0000-0002-1025-5643; Azerbaijan National Academy of Sciences / AMEA, Institute of Philosophy and Sociology), is a bilingual (Turkish/English) academic research corpus and interactive digital cockpit comprising 15 foundational Quranic verse monographs (QV-2026-001 through QV-2026-015). Independent External Peer Review: III. Maarif Congress (MOIJUB) Peer-Review Process (Application submitted; pending decision). PDF Inventory: 34 Külliyat PDF'i (30 Tekil Monografi + 2 TR/EN Tam Külliyat [v6.2.3] + 1 İSNAD-2 Klasik Arapça Veritabanları Rehberi [ISNAD_2_Klasik_Arapca_Veritabanlari_Rehberi.pdf] + 1 TYMM DKAB 15 Âyet Ders Tasarımı Rehberi [TYMM_DKAB_15_Ayet_Ders_Tasarimi_Rehberi.pdf]) + 2 III. Maarif Kongresi (MOIJUB) Bildiri PDF'i (Özet + Tam Metin) — Toplam 36 PDF.
